(1632, 77, 1, 'ARRIVE COCHIN', 'The ultimate tour begins with India Trip Planners team members who will be overwhelmed in receiving you at Cochin airport and you will be transferred to hotel for your check in. Relax for a while as and when you reach to your hotel. Cochin sightseeing will enrich you with the remarkable history; fascinate you with its amendable culture. So, quickly take a sunset cruise ride along the backwaters of Cochin for experiencing the illuminated views of the Marine Drive and its sides. Stay overnight in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1633, 77, 2, 'COCHIN', 'Today, you will visit the main tourist attractions of Cochin such as Dutch Palace, Jewish Synagogue, Spice Market, Hill Palace, St.Francis Church, Santa Cruz Basilica and Puthuvype Beach. To spend some romantic time with your partner you can go to Fort Kochi Beach. Later on, watch an amazing Kathakali performance which in known to be famous from its ancient times in Kerala. Return to your hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1634, 77, 3, 'COCHIN – ALLEPPEY HOUSEBOAT', 'This is going to be the ultimate day when you will leave for Alleppey to board onto the Houseboat. Earlier, Houseboats were known as Kettuvallams or Rice Boats which were used as ferries to carry rice, now it has come out in the modern form. You will take your lunch on the houseboat and after that, you will be taken on a cruise through the narrow canals of the Vembanad Lake. The floating markets in canoes and exotic landscapes of rolling paddy fields around all add an ethnic touch to the cruise. The stay is on houseboat itself. So, enjoy the sunset and later do peacefully the gazing of stars which can be rarely done when in crowded cities. Also, enjoy your dinner with the sounds of water gushing through and fro over the moors.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1635, 77, 4, 'ALLEPPEY – KUMARAKOM', 'Move to the next destination after breakfast that is Kumarakom. As per your arrival, you will check into the hotel which is already reserved for you. Get the fantastic Ayurvedic treatments of massage and spa which is being offered by the resorts and get relaxed right in the lap of nature. Enjoy the views of greenery and the fascinating beauty of the place in the evening. Overnight stay is at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1636, 77, 5, 'KUMARAKOM', 'Kumarakom is situated on the shores of the tranquil Vembanad Lake which is around 14 km from Kottayam. It is the best place in whole Kerala for clicking pictures of the scenic beauty. It caters many small clusters of islands which make it more beautiful. Kumarakom has become very famous now and it attracts many tourists from all over the world; also it has grown up as a bird sanctuary. It is the best place to be upon over holidays, offering beautiful surroundings. There are many things to do additionally such as boating and fishing. On request, Canoe trips can be organized and are best enjoyed early in the morning or during the evenings. After this fun-filled day, you will return to your hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1637, 77, 6, 'KUMARAKOM – PERIYAR', 'After your delightful breakfast, drive to Periyar which is also called as Thekkady on the 6th day of your trip. It is one of the most popular wildlife sanctuaries in South India. Periyar is an area of serene lakes, dense woods, craggy hills and spice gardens. Check into the hotel as per your arrival. Relax for some time and then in the afternoon, go for sightseeing of this magical place of South India. Later, return to the hotel for overnight stay', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1638, 77, 7, 'PERIYAR', 'The day is dedicated for Periyar; so after breakfast start your sightseeing with Periyar Wildlife Sanctuary. Here to get a view of large variety of wildlife species like Wild Elephants, Sambar Deer, Nilgiri Langur, Wild Bison, Wild Boar and also some unique birds; then take a Wildlife cruise. After finishing up with the wildlife sanctuary, explore the Hill Station and Spice Plantation where you can do certain activities like Bamboo Rafting, Trekking and Elephant ride. Later, get back to the hotel for a comfortable night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1639, 77, 8, 'PERIYAR – MUNNAR', 'Proceed to your next destination which is Munnar after a delightful breakfast at the hotel. Munnar is a place which is full of joyous beauty. Upon arrival, get to check into the hotel. Begin the sightseeing of Munnar and in evening you can walk through the Munnar Tea Museum and also visit the Cardamom Curing Centre. Spend your night in hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1640, 77, 9, 'MUNNAR', 'Today after your breakfast, you are going to spend a full day sightseeing of this extraordinary place, Munnar. A vacation plan at Munnar will be etched in your memory for years as it consists of Emerald green hills with mist looming over them like wandering ghosts. Start by exploring Eravikulam National Park which is approximately 30 minutes away from Munnar and Nilgiri Thaars is the main attraction of this park being protected at its best. Return and explore Attukal Waterfalls, Mattupetty Dam, Echo Point, Kundala Lake and Mount Carmel. After that, have your dinner at the hotel and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1641, 77, 10, 'MUNNAR', 'The morning breeze at this place giving you perfect picture when waterfalls down the hills makes a sound of numerous streams of gurgle along generating a feeling in you that you never want to go back from here. After your breakfast, we will move further to do the exploration of Chinnar Wildlife Sanctuary, Amaravati Reserve Forest, Kurinjimala Sanctuary, Anamudi Shola National Park and the Pampadum Shola National Park. A visit to all these is going to be highly educational and peaceful. In the end, explore the more quiet and scenic spot named as Devikulam Lake. One can also choose to do some other activities such as cycling, paragliding, rock climbing and much more. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:01'),
(1642, 77, 11, 'MUNNAR – ATHIRAPALLY', 'From Munnar, it takes nearly four hours to reach to your next planned destination that is Athirapally. In between, you will take a stopover at Guruvayoor which is the hallowed town close to Thrissur that is well-known for its fabled Shree Krishna Temple. Non-Hindus are not allowed inside the temple premises is the only a hitch. But the narrow lanes with blooming trees on sides that lead to the temple is a huge treat and is just not to be missed part of your plan. Enjoy there and then as per your arrival, check into the hotel for a comfortable overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:02'),
(1643, 77, 12, 'ATHIRAPALLY', 'Today, the complete day is scheduled for Athirapally which is positioned at the opening point of the Sholayar forest range. After your breakfast, get on the ride to see its unparallel beauty which defies even words. We will start with its mighty waterfalls which is of over 80 ft that cascade down the rocks with a furious roar as it sprinkles you, is the best sight to behold on this Kerala trip. Then from there, we will move to explore Kauthuka Park followed by Charpa Waterfalls for an ultimate bird watching near to it. Later, return to your hotel for a comfortable stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1644, 77, 13, 'ATHIRAPALLY – WAYANAD', 'After breakfast, we will check out from Athirapally and will head towards Wayanad which is Eden, if Kerala is the God’s own country. As per your arrival, check into the hotel. Later, we will begin with the sightseeing of Wayanad which is filled with all tropical rainforests, grassy meadows, expansive tea estates and aromatic spice gardens. We will visit the imperious Edakkal caves and the Jain shrines at Wayanad. After that, enjoy your night with delicious dinner and a relaxing night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1645, 77, 14, 'WILDLIFE ADVENTURE AT WAYANAD', 'The super fantastic 14th day of your trip on which you will be excursing the well known site of Wayanad known as “The Wayanad Wildlife Sanctuary”. It is home to a variety of indigenous species of animals and birds. Enjoy your safari in this wildlife sanctuary by capturing the clicks of different species. Later in the afternoon, you will drive to Kuruva Island which is a lonely group of islets spot in the middle of the River Kabini. After that, come back to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1646, 77, 15, 'WAYANAD – TELLICHERRY', 'Today you will move to Tellicherry which is also known as Thalassery is a boisterous fishing town close to the northern edge of Calicut. Check into your pre booked hotel, as per your arrival. Later on in the evening, there will be a traditional dance performance will be arranged for you named as Theyyam. Spend a night in this beautiful part of Kerala.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1647, 77, 16, 'TELLICHERRY', 'After your breakfast, we will visit the grand Tellicherry Fort which is structured magnificently. On returning from the fort, we will stop over at the vibrant fish markets of Tellicherry. After that, we will explore the Ramaswami Temple and then a short drive away to the picturesque and pleasing Muzhipillangad Beach. The extreme beauty and the white sand will please you with ultimate joy and happiness. Relax there for a while and then return to the hotel for a peaceful night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1648, 77, 17, 'TELLICHERRY – NILESHWAR', 'From Tellicherry, take a journey towards Nileshwar after your breakfast at the hotel. A visit to this destination is going to be a lifetime memorable site of this complete Kerala trip. Reach Nileshwar and check into the already reserved hotel for you. Relax for some time and then do the excursion of this extraordinary place of South India. This is the best place to relax with an Ayurveda massage at a resort. In the evening, you will pay a visit to the renowned Hindustan Kalari Sangam, which is one of the oldest in the world and gives world class training in ‘Kalaripayattu’ that is the Kerala martial arts. Return to the hotel for night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:03'),
(1649, 77, 18, 'NILESHWAR', 'As this is the last destination to explore, enjoy every bit of it. After your delicious breakfast, we will be taking you to the massive Neeleswaram Palace. The architecture style of this palace is remarkable. After that, we will be exploring Shree Muthappan Temple which consists of beautiful hall and shrines. In the end, you will relax at the Azhithala Beach which is the prime and beautiful spot of Nileshwar. Return back to the hotel and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:04'),
(1650, 77, 19, 'NILESHWAR – COCHIN DEPARTURE', 'It is the end and the goodbye moment from this tour of “Kerala with a Difference”. India Trip Planners representative will guide you to the Cochin airport to catch the return flight for your onward destination. We serve the best and maintain our values with the best in all amenities. Thank you for giving us a chance to serve you', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 08:00:04'),
(1651, 78, 1, 'MUMBAI - BARODA', 'India Trip Planners will welcome you at Baroda and get you some brief details of the tour plan while getting transferred to the hotel. The tour starts with Baroda which is one of the major known cities in Gujarat that is extremely famous for its art galleries and massive museums. After visiting these you will get introduced to the history of the state and its prime legacies. After the architectural sites of Baroda, you will visit the historical city of Champaner which is located in about 50 km from Baroda. This city houses the world heritage site named as Pavagadh Archaeological Park. While being in here at this destination, do not miss to visit the tribal hamlets of Chhota Udepur and the exotic paintings which double up the beauty of the walls of their houses. Return back to Baroda for your night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1652, 78, 2, 'BARODA - AHMEDABAD', 'From Baroda, you will be traveling to Ahmedabad which is one of the most popular cities in the state from both point of view, may it be the business related guests or the leisure tourists. Ahmedabad is called to be one of the most preferred tourist destinations in the country. So, get yourself check into the hotel. The mausoleums and the mosques which are here show an impressive insight into the art and architecture of the late centuries. An Indo-Saracen style of architecture is being housed on the monuments of Ahmedabad which is totally a treat to every onlooker. You could also visit the famous Gandhi Ashram and the several other museums for getting in touch with the various different style of architecture. Return to the hotel at Ahmedabad and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1653, 78, 3, 'AHMEDABAD - LOTHAL', 'In the morning, visit the splendid mansions which are known as \'havelis\'. These havelis are the residences of the rich traders and are no less than palaces. The best can be gained by strolling through these beautifully carved havelis with remarkable architecture. After the visit to havelis, you will proceed towards next destination Lothal which is another historically significant town of India. The archeological side of Lothal is extremely known and has become a very important center. It showcases mind blowing designing, planning, and architecture of the era. Relax and stay for overnight at Lothal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1654, 78, 4, 'LOTHAL - PALITANA - DIU', 'Proceed towards Palitana on the 4th day of the tour, it is renowned for its temple complex. Jain pilgrims mostly visit the complex situated on top of the Shatrunjaya hill. The temple complex caters more than 1300 temples in its circumference and all are beautifully carved out of pure marble. After your visit to the Jain religious site, now it is time to move on to visit the Portuguese sites housed in Gujarat and to do so, you will have to move ahead to Diu where the architectural styles of 16th and 17th century churches will attract all the artists in large numbers. The Portuguese forts are also there, so visit it after the churches. Return to hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1655, 78, 5, 'PALITANA - SOMNATH - GIR', 'On the 5th day of the tour early in the morning, begin your day by traveling to Somnath. It is a place of great significance for the Hindus religion. It is worldwide famous due to its temple which consists of the twelve Jyotirlingas of Lord Shiva and on special dates and occasions, this place is fully crowded by thousands of devotees. A visit to the Somnath temple is going to relish you with its beauty and architecture. From Somnath, travel towards Gir which is your next destination of this tour plan. Reach and stay for overnight in hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1656, 78, 6, 'GIR - JUNAGADH – GONDAL', 'The tour plan is totally incomplete without covering this fantastic wildlife sanctuary of Gujarat that is Gir National Park. It cannot be imagined without including the Gir National Park. It is frequently visited by the tourists for the exotic view of Lion’s collection. After your visit to the wildlife, you will proceed towards the historically rich place that is Junagadh. Junagadh is famous for its various different numbers of forts and palaces that were once residences of the members of the royal family. To get the detailed insights of legacies and history, then visit the Junagadh Museums. After all this in Junagadh, the next destination which you will be visiting is Gondal which is extremely famous for the Naulakha Palace. This place is a must visit type of destination which is being included in this tour plan circuit. Stay for an overnight here in Gondal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1657, 78, 7, 'GONDAL - DASADA', 'An architectural trip to Gujarat has much more to offer you with such as deserts. Therefore on this day, you will begin with a short excursion to the Rann of Kutch. It is renowned for its distinct wildlife; this area is also fondly frequented for the vibrant villages that surround it. On your way, you will also visit the artisans of Dasada before you arrive in Jhijhwada. The history and architecture of this place can be very well acknowledged of the early centuries. Overnight stay is arranged in Dasada.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1658, 78, 8, 'DASADA - MODHERA - PATAN - BALARAM', 'This day is dedicated for a combination of the destinations in which you will be covering Modhera, Patan and Balaram. So leave for Modhera from Dasada after your breakfast. One of the most exotic Hindu temples in western India is The Sun temple as it is believed that a prayer here never goes unanswered. The architecture style is amazing too. After your visit to Modhera, you will halt at your next destination which is Patan which is famous for its ancient and grand step-well and is most celebrated site of the country. From Patan, visit Balaram which is known for its exquisite palace named as Balaram Palace. Explore the houses of the princely state and enjoy the architecture and its creative art. Rest at your pre-booked hotel at Balaram and spend a comfortable night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22');
INSERT INTO `package_itinerary` (`id`, `package_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `meals`, `accommodation`, `activities`, `display_order`, `created_at`) VALUES
(1659, 78, 9, 'BALARAM - TARANGA - VADNAGAR - AHMEDABAD', 'On the 9th day, travel from Balaram towards Taranga and Vadnagar which are the historical sites for its heritage and attracts guests from all over the world to visit and gain a wonderful as well as magical experience by being here. Taranga is renowned for its Jain Temples and Vadnagar, on the other hand, is most visited for its exotic and pleasing collection of ancient buildings and grand monuments. After visiting these medieval Indian cities, you will then proceed towards Ahmedabad which is your final destination of this tour plan. Check in and an overnight stay at the Ahmedabad hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1660, 78, 10, 'AHMEDABAD', 'This is going to be the last day of your architectural tour of Gujarat and Mumbai. According to your flight schedules, get transferred to the Ahmedabad airport for your final voyage back home. The trip is a perfect choice for exploration of the architecture side of both these sites. It is a combination of historic as well as entertainment at its best.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:03:22'),
(1673, 79, 1, 'ARRIVE DELHI', 'You will be welcomed by India Trip Planners coordinator and will be glad to receive you at Delhi airport. Our representative will then assist you to your pre-booked hotel for your check in. A city tour will be organized after you get refreshed. After that, return to the hotel for your overnight stay. You are going to get wonderful memories on being on this tour plan so get geared up.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1674, 79, 2, 'DELHI SIGHTSEEING & PHOTOSHOOT', 'The capital city Delhi is fully loaded with amazing creations, so incarcerate them in your camera the beautiful historic sites and many things more. So beginning with the first monument named as Red Fort. It is made of red sandstone and has two grand gates. You will get a good background for getting clicks with this monument. Then you will visit Jama Masjid which is the biggest mosque of India and is approximately 500 m away in distance from Red Fort. On continuing with other attractive spots in Delhi such as the India Gate, Humayun’s Tomb, Akshardham Temple, Laxmi Narayan Temple, Qutub Minar, Gandhi memorial and the Rashtrapati Bhavan; which is also famous as President House and after that drive through the oldest famous area wherein you will get to capture good pictures named as Chandni Chowk and Raj Ghat. Spend a night in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1675, 79, 3, 'DELHI – UDAIPUR', 'After this fantastic visit to Delhi, you will drive towards Udaipur. Our representative will then assist you to your pre-booked hotel for your check in as and when you arrive. In the evening, you will go for the sightseeing tour of the breathtaking royal buildings around Lake Pichola in a boat. The fantastic view will please you and outperform the beauty by getting clicked here. Enjoy the beautiful night at Udaipur city and stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1676, 79, 4, 'UDAIPUR SIGHTSEEING & PHOTOSHOOT', 'Let’s begin with the photo shoot and exploration of this city with the City Palace which is the largest royal complex in Rajasthan. From this palace, the complete view of the city is so clear and absolutely vivid, so definitely a wide view in the clicks too. Next, you will be taken to Jagdish temple which was built by Maharana Jagat Singh and is dedicated to Lord Jagannath. After that, you will drive through the old city of Udaipur to reach Fateh Sagar Lake which is filled with serenity and is the best place to get clicked. Also, visit the Saheliyon-Ki-Bari which was created for the retreat of the royal household ladies to spend their time when free. In the evening, you will visit Monsoon Palace and do shopping in this beautiful city. Return to your hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1677, 79, 5, 'UDAIPUR – BUNDI', 'In the morning, proceed to Bundi from Udaipur which is your next destination in the tour plan. So quickly move forward with the plan and reach Bundi. Check into the hotel and do the local sightseeing of Bundi which is a city small in nature but major capture of Rajasthan tourists. You will start by visiting Taragah fort which is again a good destination for capturing. Later do the exploration of Sukh Mahal and also cover Chhatra Sagar. Return to the hotel, rest and spend a night at Bundi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1678, 79, 6, 'BUNDI – RANTHAMBORE', 'Ranthambore is famous and only known majorly for its Ranthambore National Park. So, leave for Ranthambore after breakfast at Bundi hotel. On the way, the beauty of nature is going to please you with its serenity. Upon arrival at Ranthambore, our representative will transfer you to the pre-booked resort. Leave for Jungle Safari at this wildlife sanctuary after your lunch. You will capture the clicks of beautiful species and especially the royal Bengal tigers. This is the best place for wildlife photography. Later, return to the resort for an overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1679, 79, 7, 'RANTHAMBORE SIGHTSEEING & PHOTOSHOOT', 'On the 7th day, we will go for safari at Ranthambore National Park another wing. Each wing has different species. You will spot and capture in your camera many other wild animals and some beautiful exotic species of birds too. Spend time doing the safari and enjoy the beauty of nature. After your lunch, you will be taken to Ranthambore Fort on the hilltop and then to the famous and attractive Ganesh Temple. Explore the fantastic rolling green hills and click good pictures while returning back from the temple. After that, visit Surwal Lake, Padam Lake, Kachida Valley, and Jogi Mahal. Return to the hotel for overnight stay', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1680, 79, 8, 'RANTHAMBORE – JAIPUR', 'In the morning, begin your road journey towards Jaipur. As per your arrival, check into a hotel. Relax for a while and then continue with your sightseeing starting with City Palace which consists of massive gateways and courtyards. Later in the evening, enjoy the rickshaw ride in the colorful market area of Jaipur. Return to the hotel and relax overnight following with night meal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1681, 79, 9, 'JAIPUR SIGHTSEEING & PHOTOSHOOT', 'Before munching your breakfast, you will be taken to the massive Amber Fort by a ride oven an elephant; visiting the countryside of the fort. You will get beautiful early morning pictures here at this Fort. Further, with this, we will do the sightseeing of the Hall of Victory. In the afternoon, visit Birla Mandir, Jantar Mantar would be your next site then Nawab Sahab Ki Haveli, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Nahargarh fort. Later in the evening, visit Chokhi Dhani for getting the Rajasthani themed clicks and dinner with which you will get to see many different art and crafts all over the site. Return back and stay overnight in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1682, 79, 10, 'JAIPUR – AGRA', 'Leave for Agra via road after your breakfast and witness the amazing beauty of Mughals. Check into a pre-booked hotel upon your arrival at Agra. You will be taken on a tour of the beautiful Agra city. Firstly, you will be taken to the magnificent Taj Mahal which is amongst the wonder of the world. People from all over the globe visit Agra for getting pictures along with their partners at this remarkable and romantic monument. After that get back to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1683, 79, 11, 'AGRA SIGHTSEEING & PHOTOSHOOT', 'On the 11th day, explore and capture the remaining spots of Agra which are the Tomb of Itmad-Ud-Daula which is also known as Baby Taj, you will visit the massive Agra Fort which consists of the Pearl Mosque, Diwan-e-am and Diwan-e-Khas and then finishes up with the elegant Mehtab Bagh. Return to the hotel for overnight comfortable and peaceful stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1684, 79, 12, 'AGRA – DELHI', 'Check out from Agra, move forward for final destination Delhi. Our representative will then assist you to catch your flight for your way back to pavilion. We offer our thanks for choosing this special 11 Nights 12 Days Rajasthan Village & Wildlife Photography Tour by India Trip Planners and folding good captures along. We will be glad to serve you.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:10:41'),
(1685, 80, 1, 'ARRIVE KOLKATA', 'Our company representative will meet you at Kolkata airport and then will assist you to check into your pre-booked hotel which is in the heart of the city. After some relaxation at the hotel, you will be taken for a guided tour of textile side of sightseeing and also you will be visiting the textile marketplaces which are nearby to the hotel. Henceforth, return to your hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1686, 80, 2, 'KOLKATA SIGHTSEEING', 'Kolkata is famous for its textile all over the world; it caters the best to its guests. The major excursion will be including the city sites such as Fort William, Gurusaday Museum, Howrah Bridge, Indian Museum, Jawahar Shishu Bhawan, Kalighat Kali Temple, Nakhoda Mosque, the Parashnath Jain Temple and lastly Bara Bazar which is known as the main textile section of the city. Henceforth in the evening, we will continue our tour by covering the Botanical Garden, an amazing place for people who have profound love for nature. Enjoy an overnight stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1687, 80, 3, 'KOLKATA - BHUBANESWAR', 'After your breakfast, you will get transferred to the Kolkata airport to catch a flight to your next destination Bhubaneswar. As and when you reach Bhubaneswar, check-in at the hotel. Take a tour to major tourist attractions like the Lingaraj Temple, Rajarani Temple, Mukteswar Temple, Cactus Garden and Ekamra Kanan while being in this temple city of India. Later, you will be visiting the twin hills of Khandagiri and Udaygiri for its fantastic rock-cut caves. Bhubaneswar is famous and well-known for its Tie and Dye Textile Industry, so in the evening we will visit the industry. Your overnight comfortable stay is at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1688, 80, 4, 'BHUBANESWAR – SAMBALPUR', 'Leave for Sambalpur in the morning after your breakfast at Bhubaneswar. On your way to Sambalpur, you will halt at the midway to visit Nuapatna which is the handloom weaver’s village. They have been weaving handloom cloths from generations. The resist method of tie and dye was involved. After this fruitful visit, you will continue your ride to Sambalpur. As and when you reach Sambalpur, check-in at the hotel. It is actually the center for the complete textile industry which is spread over western Orissa. The Sambalpuri Sarees are worldwide famous for their intricate and unique designs. Later in the afternoon, you will visit the Gole Bazaar which has a great collection of beautiful and designer sarees. After the textile visit, do some exploration of the Sambalpur like Ushakothi Wildlife Sanctuary, Hirakund Dam, and the Huma Temple. Return to the hotel for peaceful overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1689, 80, 5, 'SAMBHALPUR - BOUDH', 'At your own leisure, leave for Boudh after your lavish breakfast. This destination is famous for Silk Bomkai Saree, Cotton Tie and Dye Saree and Silk Tie and Dye Saree. In the evening visit the Boudh market for shopping of these collections of different and fabulous sarees. Later, return to the hotel for overnight stay', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1690, 80, 6, 'BOUDH - BISSAM CUTTACK', 'On the 6th day of your wonderful textile tour, proceed to Bissam Cuttack after your breakfast. On your way to Bissam Cuttack, you will halt at the Phulbani and Kutia Kondh villages to explore the art. Later continue your drive and reach Bissam Cuttack. As per your arrival, get transferred to the hotel followed by dinner and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1691, 80, 7, 'BISSAM CUTTACK - JEYPORE', 'Today morning, you will head straight to visit one of the famous Dongeria Kondh villages. After the exploration of the village, you will trek down the hills along with the tribal’s to further witness the beauty of their Wednesday weekly market at Chatikona. Enjoy your lunch at Chatikona and later proceed to Jeypore. As and when you reach Jeypore, check-in at the pre-booked hotel. Overnight stay is at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1692, 80, 8, 'JEYPORE', 'Jeypore is the land of abundance and is home to Orissa’s vast tribal population. So begin with the exploration and witness the delight dance performance of the Parajas tribe. It is the commercial nerve center of Koraput district and consists of all such facilities to make a firm base for visiting the places of interest in and around the areas. Return to the hotel for overnight stay', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1693, 80, 9, 'JEYPORE - MALKANGIRI', 'You will leave for Malkangiri this morning and on your way, you will visit the Friday weekly market at Maithili. Continue your drive to Malkangiri after the visit to the weekly market. As per you reach Malkangiri, check-in will be arranged at your pre-booked hotel. Relax for a while and then have lunch. After that, you will visit An Iralgundi the Koya village. Later in the evening, you are going to witness the Bison head dance of the tribals. Get back to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1694, 80, 10, 'MALKANGIRI - RAYAGADA', 'Today, you are going to explore many spots. So after your breakfast at Malkangiri, check out and drive towards Mudulipada. On reaching the beautiful destination Mudulipada, get involved around the Bonda villages and take the textile tour. Later after this, lunch at Khairput and in the evening, you will proceed to Rayagada. Explore the beauty of this place with textile nature too and then get back to hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1695, 80, 11, 'RAYAGADA - TAPTAPANI', 'After breakfast in the morning, you will commence a drive towards Taptapani. On your way, you are going to visit the Langia Soura village and enjoy the experience of their colorful war dance. As you reach Taptapani, check-in at the pre-booked hotel. Relax and stay for overnight at Taptapani.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1696, 80, 12, 'TAPTAPANI - BHUBANESWAR', 'At Taptapani, do the sightseeing by exploration of the Chilka Lake after your breakfast. After this lake visit, you will now visit Kalijai Temple in the mid of the lake. You will enjoy the boat ride there. Take your lunch at Barkul and then you will start your drive to Bhubaneswar. On arrival at Bhubaneswar, you will check-in at the hotel. Relax and enjoy dinner followed by an overnight stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1697, 80, 13, 'BHUBANESWAR - KOLKATA', 'The day is dedicated to do the guided city tour of this beautiful destination Bhubaneswar. The major and famous tourist attractions of Bhubaneswar include the Brahmeswara Temple, Bindu Sarovar, ISKON Temple and the Tribal Museum. After all these, check out from hotel and reach at Bhubaneswar airport to catch a flight to Kolkata. Reach Kolkata and check-in at the pre-booked hotel. The rest of the day is to relax in the hotel. Later in the evening, you will take a leisurely walk to explore the local market of Kolkata nearby your hotel. Overnight stay is at the hotel itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1698, 80, 14, 'KOLKATA DEPARTURE', 'Take your breakfast and then check out from the hotel on time. The tour ends with a lot of memorable moments. Drive to Kolkata airport and then catch your flight to get back to your pavilion. We are thankful in serving you with this India’s Off Beat tour plan of Textile Tour for 13 Nights and 14 Days.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:15:04'),
(1699, 81, 1, 'ARRIVE MUMBAI', 'India Trip Planners will welcome you at Mumbai and get you some brief details of the tour plan while getting transferred to the hotel. As per your arrival, check into the hotel. Relax for a while and later, you will get on the major tourist attractions of Mumbai which includes Prince of Wales Museum, Parliament House and the Jain temple. It can include going to the marketplaces in the close proximity of the hotel in the late evening. Return to the hotel for dinner and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1700, 81, 2, 'MUMBAI', 'Get geared up as today we are going to do the full day sightseeing of Mumbai. Have your breakfast and then we begin with the sightseeing tour. The Gateway of India is the topmost attraction for the tourists, so we will visit it and after that Mount May Church, followed by the Siddhivinayak Temple. After all these, we will move to the famous beaches known as Juhu and Chaupati Beaches wherein you will get the mouth watering snacks. Later, enjoy the fantastic views of Arabian Sea while walking on Marine Drive and Princess Neckless too. After this fun-filled day, return back to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1701, 81, 3, 'MUMBAI – AHMEDABAD', 'Do some more Mumbai sightseeing after your breakfast; you will be taken to the jetty at the Gateway of India wherein you will board the ferry to visit the island housing Elephanta Caves. The centuries-old sculptures will be mind blowing; everything will be so eye catchy there. Later in the afternoon take your lunch and relax in your hotel room. In the evening leave for Ahmedabad by road. On reaching Ahmedabad, check-in at the pre-booked hotel. Stay for the night at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1702, 81, 4, 'AHMEDABAD', 'The day tour starts with Ahmedabad which is one of the major known cities in Gujarat that is extremely famous for its art galleries and massive museums. Ahmedabad is one of the most popular cities in the state from both point of view, may it be the business related guests or the leisure tourists. The mausoleums and the mosques which are here show an impressive insight into the art and architecture of the late centuries. An Indo-Saracen style of architecture is being housed on the monuments of Ahmedabad which is totally a treat to every onlooker. You will also visit the famous Gandhi Ashram, Sidi Sayed Mosque, Bhadra Fort and the Kankaria Lake and the several other museums such as visit the Calico Museum of Textile for getting in touch with the various different styles of materials. Return to the hotel at Ahmedabad and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1703, 81, 5, 'AHMEDABAD SIGHTSEEING', 'Ahmedabad is called to be one of the most preferred tourist destinations in the country. In the morning, visit the splendid mansions which are known as \'havelis\'. These havelis are the residences of the rich traders and are no less than palaces. The best can be gained by strolling through these beautifully carved havelis with remarkable architecture. After the visit to havelis, proceed for a museum tour of Ahmedabad. The major museums to visit will include Sardar Patel National Memorial, Sabarmati Ashram and the Hussain Doshi Gufa. After the marvelous visit, return to the hotel for your dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1704, 81, 6, 'AHMEDABAD – KOLKATA', 'On the 6th day in the morning, you get transferred to the Ahmedabad airport to catch a flight to Kolkata as per your schedule. As per your arrival at Kolkata, our representative will meet at the airport and will guide you to your pre-booked hotel. Check-in at the hotel and relax for a while in your hotel room. In the evening, just take a walk to local market of Kolkata at your own leisure. Stay for the night at the hotel.\r\n\r\nAfter your breakfast, commence your day by sightseeing tour of Kolkata. The tourist attractions which are major of Kolkata include Science City, Metro Rail, Victoria Marble Palace, Memorial Hall, Belur Math, China Town, Mother Teresa Home, and the Vidyasagar Setu. Evening schedule is at leisure and later enjoy your dinner and overnight stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1705, 81, 7, 'KOLKATA – BAGDOGRA – DARJEELING', 'On the 8th day, get transferred to the Kolkata airport to board a flight to Bagdogra post breakfast. After your arrival at Bagdogra airport, our coordinator will meet you and take you to Darjeeling by car. The serene and scenic beauty is being provided on low hilly terrain of Darjeeling. On your way to Darjeeling, you will visit the very famous Teesta River flowing and adding to the beauty of the place. As per your arrival at Darjeeling, you will check in into the pre-booked hotel and relax for a while. In the evening, explore the place for alluring and mesmerizing beauty by taking a walk on the lanes of this beautiful place. Enjoy an overnight stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1706, 81, 8, 'DARJEELING – MIRIK – DARJEELING', 'You will head straight for a full day excursion to Mirik which is a sleepy hill town in the Darjeeling district after your breakfast in the morning. This is going to be a two and half hours drive which will cover a wonderful scenic drive through the amazing tea gardens which are laid on the slopes of the hill. As and when you reach Mirik, you will visit Mirik Lake which is the top ranked attractive place for the tourists. By being here, you can sit along the bank of the lake and relax in this calm and soothing place. In the end, you may enjoy boating in the lake or take the arching footbridge cross over the other side of the lake and explore another attractive spot, the Dhupi forest. Later in the evening, you will return to Darjeeling for a comfortable overnight stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1707, 81, 9, 'DARJEELING', 'On the 10th day, you will take a ride to Tiger Hill that is famous for the beautiful views of Kangchenjunga and Mount Everest. The sunrise is so special of this place due to which it is visited by several tourists from all over the world. In the next part of this beautiful day, you will visit the Himalayan Mountaineering Institute Zoo that caters two massive museums namely the Everest Museum and the Mountaineering Museum. The Himalayan Mountaineering Institute runs the zoo and the two museums and is taking in charge of it beautifully. Later in the evening, you will visit the Ghoom Monastery and there you will enjoy the toy train ride for a different experience. Return to the hotel for a peaceful night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1708, 81, 10, 'DARJEELING - BAGDOGRA - DELHI', 'This is your travelling day, so in the morning after breakfast you will get transferred to the Bagdogra airport to board your flight to Delhi. On arrival at Delhi, you will check-in at your pre-booked hotel. Later, take a leisurely walk on the streets of Delhi. Rest of the time is free for you to relax. Enjoy your delicious dinner and overnight stay in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1709, 81, 11, 'DELHI', 'There are many major museums in Delhi which are famous and visited by people from all over the world. So, begin with the exploration after your delightful breakfast. The museums which are famous of Delhi include Air Force Museum, Craft Museum, Archaeological Museum and the Gandhi Museum. The museums of Delhi details very well about the heritage and history of Delhi and people visit to enhance their knowledge. Return to the hotel for an overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1710, 81, 12, 'DELHI SIGHTSEEING', 'Today do the city tour of the Delhi starting with New Delhi – Humayun’s Tomb, Akshardham Temple, Laxmi Narayan Temple, The Iron Pillar, The Qutub Minar, India Gate, Parliament House, Purana Quila, Jantar Mantar and lastly Connaught Place which is known as the main shopping section of the capital. Henceforth after lunch, we will continue our tour by covering the Old Delhi - the Jama Masjid Mosque, Red Fort, Gandhi memorial, and after that drive through the crowded lanes of Chandni Chowk and Raj Ghat. Spend a beautiful night in the capital city, Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1711, 81, 13, 'DELHI DEPARTURE', 'After breakfast, it is the time for your check out from the hotel. It is the moment to say goodbye and catch your flight for your onward destination. We will be thankful in serving you with this 13 Nights 14 Days Museum Tour of India. The tour ends here', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:25:45'),
(1712, 82, 1, 'ARRIVE DELHI', 'Our company representative will meet you at Delhi Airport and then will assist you to check into your pre-booked hotel which is in the heart of the city. After some relaxation at the hotel, you will be taken for a guided tour of Delhi sightseeing and also you will be visiting the marketplaces which are nearby to the hotel. Henceforth, return to your hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1713, 82, 2, 'DELHI SIGHTSEEING', 'Delhi is an extraordinary tourist place and being the capital city, it caters the best to its guests. The excursion will be divided into two half’s; New Delhi and Old Delhi respectively. So firstly on beginning with New Delhi – start with Humayun’s Tomb, Akshardham Temple, Laxmi Narayan Temple, The Iron Pillar, The Qutub Minar, India Gate, Parliament House, Purana Quila, Jantar Mantar and lastly Connaught Place which is known as the main shopping section of the capital. Henceforth after lunch, we will continue our tour by covering the Old Delhi - the Jama Masjid Mosque, Red Fort, Gandhi memorial, and after that drive through the crowded lanes of Chandni Chowk and Raj Ghat. Spend a beautiful night in the capital city, Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1714, 82, 3, 'DELHI - AHMEDABAD', 'On arrival at Ahmedabad, you will check into the hotel. Ahmedabad is one of the major known cities in Gujarat that is extremely famous for its art galleries and massive museums. It is one of the most popular cities in the state from both point of view, may it be the business related guests or the leisure tourists. The mausoleums and the mosques which are here show an impressive insight into the art and architecture of the late centuries. An Indo-Saracen style of architecture is being housed on the monuments of Ahmedabad which is totally a treat to every onlooker. You will also visit the famous Gandhi Ashram, Sidi Sayed Mosque, Bhadra Fort and the Kankaria Lake and the several other museums such as visit the Calico Museum of Textile for getting in touch with the various different styles of materials. Return to the hotel at Ahmedabad and stay for overnight', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1715, 82, 4, 'AHMEDABAD - DUNGARPUR', 'Now on this day from Ahmedabad, you\'ll be directed to Dungarpur which is your next destination. On arriving, you will check into the Udai Bilas Palace which is the heritage hotel at Dungarpur. You will feel like a royalty staying at this exquisite and grand place. Start with your sightseeing by India\'s one of the oldest tribes that is the Bheels. You will meet the tribal people up close and get into the style of their life. Return and you will get to encounter many different species of birds at the Udai Bilas Palace. Later, you will stay for the night at this grand palace.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1716, 82, 5, 'DUNGARPUR - UDAIPUR', 'After this fantastic visit to Dungarpur, you will drive towards Udaipur. Our representative will then assist you to your pre-booked hotel for your check in as and when you arrive. Let’s begin with the exploration starting with the City Palace which is the largest royal complex in Rajasthan. From this palace, the complete view of the city is so clear and absolutely vivid. Next, you will be taken to Jagdish temple which was built by Maharana Jagat Singh and is dedicated to Lord Jagannath. After that, you will drive through the old city of Udaipur to reach Fateh Sagar Lake which is filled with serenity. In the evening, you will go for the sightseeing tour of the breathtaking royal buildings around Lake Pichola in a boat. Enjoy the beautiful night at Udaipur city and stay at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1717, 82, 6, 'UDAIPUR - GHANERAO', 'After your breakfast, you will be leaving for Ghanerao via road. After reaching via road to the destination our representative will be there for your check into the pre-booked hotel. The castle of Ghanerao is strewn with royal havelis, murals, archways, marble citadels and old paintings on walls that will give you a feel of old beautiful times. It is a property of royal family of Mewar. Now that it has come up with all the modern amenities, the castle now recreates the lifestyle of lords of the past. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1718, 82, 7, 'GHANERAO - NARLAI', 'Drive from Ghanerao after breakfast and head next to the famous place named as Narlai. It is enriched with many premium hotels with best amenities now at Narlai. Narlai is situated on the footsteps of Aravali Hills. After arriving at this place our representative will transfer you to the hotel for comforting stay. Today, you will enjoy the jeep ride to the village and explore the beauty. It is going to give you really a remarkable experience. Later return to the hotel for relaxing overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1719, 82, 8, 'NARLAI - SODAWAS', 'On the 8th day, you will be driven to Sodawas which is a seventeenth century village after your breakfast. As per your arrival, you will check into the Sodawas Kot perched on a hilltop. You will be taken on an interesting sightseeing of this magnificent village by exploring the local school, bustling bazaar and a famous village temple. Join with the local people of the place and have an opportunity to discuss Rajasthani culture, traditions and the rich heritage. After that, return to the hotel for your overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1720, 82, 9, 'SODAWAS - ROHET', 'Another interesting village site of sixteenth century is going to be explored next. So, leave from Sodawas and travel towards Rohet which is a Rajput village. As and when you arrive, you will check into Rohetgarh fort which is another royal destination to stay at. By being here, you will relive the romance of the bygone era at this fortified fort. Explore Rohet in the afternoon and later enjoy a jeep safari to visit and experience the inner village aspects of Rajasthan. You will also visit and experience the smoothened mud huts and simple lifestyle of the people. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1721, 82, 10, 'ROHET - JODHPUR', 'Next destination is the Sun City, so after your breakfast at Rohet; travel towards Jodhpur. Jodhpur city is beautifully situated on the edge of the Thar Desert which is going to give you a rustic Rajasthani experience. As per your arrival, you will be transferred to the palace and relax for short span of time. Later, you will begin with the exploration of the Sun City by Jaswant Thada, the famous Mehrangarh Fort, Moti Mahal, Umaid Bhawan Palace and later you will return to your hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1722, 82, 11, 'JODHPUR - JAIPUR', 'On the 11th day of your exotic trip, you will move ahead with your drive to the capital city of Rajasthan. As per your arrival, check into a hotel. Relax for a while and then continue with your sightseeing starting with City Palace which consists of massive gateways and courtyards. Later in the evening, enjoy the rickshaw ride in the colorful market area of Jaipur. Return to the hotel and relax overnight following with night meal.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1723, 82, 12, 'JAIPUR SIGHTSEEING', 'There are many cities which are worth a visit on being in India; one of which is Jaipur which is also known as Pink city and is included in Golden Triangle Tour. Before munching your breakfast, you will be taken to the massive Amber Fort by elephant ride. Further, with this, we will do the sightseeing of the Hall of Victory. In the afternoon, visit Birla Mandir, Jantar Mantar would be your next site then Nawab Sahab Ki Haveli, Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal and Nahargarh fort. Later in the evening, visit Chokhi Dhani for getting the Rajasthani themed dinner with which you will get to see many different art and crafts all over the site. Return back and stay overnight in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1724, 82, 13, 'JAIPUR – AGRA', 'Leave for Agra via road after your breakfast and witness the amazing beauty of Mughals. Check into a pre-booked hotel upon your arrival at Agra. You will be taken on a tour of the beautiful Agra city. Firstly, you will be taken to the magnificent Taj Mahal which is amongst the wonder of the world. People from all over the globe visit Agra for this remarkable monument. After that get back to the hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1725, 82, 14, 'AGRA - DELHI', 'Then in the latter section of the plan for Agra tourism, tourists will be sightseeing the majestic Agra Fort and its massive structures such as Diwan-e-Aam, Diwan-e-Khas, Musamman Burj, and Moti Masjid. In the end, you will be visiting the tomb of Itmad-Ud-Daula. Later in the day time, you will be guided to an Indian home to witness and experience the lifestyle of Indian family. As per your schedule, get transferred to Delhi for catching the flight on the next day. Stay at Delhi for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1726, 82, 15, 'DEPARTURE', 'Now, this is the last day of your Village Tour of Rajasthan for 14 Nights and 15 Days. As per your flight schedule, you will be transferred to the airport for your onward journey. Thank you for choosing us and taking along a big bundle of memories of the wonderful trip of Rajasthan village life.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:31:13'),
(1728, 83, 1, 'ARRIVE DELHI', 'The tour commences with your arrival in Delhi where tour coordinators or guide will be there to welcome you at the airport and will transfer you to your pre-booked hotel. Refresh and unwind yourself on being at hotel. Later, you will start with your Culinary Tour of India bys sightseeing of Delhi. Enjoy the delicious dinner and stay overnight at hotel itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1729, 83, 2, 'DELHI EXPLORATIONS', 'Start your day with munching breakfast and then enjoy the heritage sites of Delhi. So, you will begin your visit to Qutub Minar, Red Fort, Lodi Gardens, etc. After these, you will also visit spice market Khari Baoroli. Let’s get the taste of both the Old and New Delhi offering the famous delicacies. The culinary of Old Delhi includes Dahi Balla, Kulia ki chat, Matar Kachori, Fruit Sandwiches at its best. The secret culinary sides of New Delhi are the Chole bhature, Jalebi, Sohan Halwa, Fruit Kulfi. By being here, you can learn about the Indian cuisine. Return to the hotel for a enjoyable overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1730, 83, 3, 'DELHI – DHARAMSALA', 'On the 3rd day, begin with delicious breakfast and then catch your flight to Dharamsala. You will also visit the nearby place which is very famous known as McLeodganj. After this in the evening, take a session of cooking classes at the hotel premises. Later, enjoy your dinner and stay for overnight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1731, 83, 4, 'DHARAMSALA - KANGRA VALLEY', 'Visit the famous Fort and Jain Temple of Kangra Valley on this 4th day after your delightful breakfast. It is the best place to learn about Himalayan top recipes. The food is very simple, yet very exotic and delicious. After learning the recipes, relax for the night here itself.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1732, 83, 5, 'KANGRA VALLEYS – AMRITSAR', 'Get geared up to depart from this lovely destination Dharamsala and head towards Amritsar after your delicious breakfast. Check into the hotel and relax for a while. Later, begin with your excursion and visit the famous Golden Temple which is very well known for its beauty. Then, here you will enjoy the Punjabi meal course which includes Bajre ki roti, Sarson da saag, maa ki dal, lehsun chatni and saag paneer. Enjoy this fantastic tandoori food and relax at the hotel for your overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1733, 83, 6, 'AMRITSAR', 'You get the additional day to be here at Amritsar as it brings a special training for you that is classes to make Tandoori Roti and Nans. So, after your breakfast, you will enjoy your classes and after that you will visit Wagah Border for the Retreat Ceremony. After enjoying at the ceremony, you will proceed to the hotel for overnight stay and enjoy the pleasing dinner beforehand.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1734, 83, 7, 'AMRITSAR – DELHI – JAIPUR', 'This is going to be the busy day for travelling from Amritsar to Delhi and then towards Jaipur finally. So, begin with departing from Amritsar after your delightful breakfast, as per your arrival at Delhi, you will hold on for your lunch. After enjoying your lunch, you will proceed towards Jaipur which is your ultimate destination. Check into the hotel as per your arrival and enjoy the pleasing dinner. Stay for overnight here in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1735, 83, 8, 'JAIPUR', 'This day is completely for exploration of the pink city, you will be taken to the massive Amber Fort early in the morning. We will go on the fort by an elephant to roam around the countryside of the fort Amber. Further, with this, we will do the sightseeing of the Hall of Victory. In the afternoon, visit Birla Mandir, Hawa Mahal, City Palace, The Govind Devji temple, Nawab Sahab Ki Haveli, Jal Mahal and then end with the beautiful Nahargarh fort. Lastly, visit Chokhi Dhani for a Rajasthani themed dinner consisting delicacy of Dal, Batti and Churma with many more exciting rides and events at the same field. Return to hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1736, 83, 9, 'JAIPUR – AGRA', 'Have delicious breakfast and then drive to your next destination Agra along one of the India’s best freeways. On the way, take a stop at the deserted capital city of Fatehpur Sikri where you will get to visit many beautiful structures of Mughal age. Continue your drive to Jaipur, check into your hotel and take some rest. After relaxation, begin with an exploration of the massive Agra Fort. The architectural styles which are being embedded in it reflect remarkable beauty. Once the Agra Fort is done, explore the next exciting destination the tomb of Itmad-Ud-Daula, Baby Taj and then finish up with the elegant Mehtab Bagh. Blissful night hold is at Agra.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1737, 83, 10, 'AGRA', 'There is an early planned visit to Taj Mahal for getting a glimpse of its extraordinary beauty when the sun rises. So your driver will guide you for a dawn visit of this wonder of the world. By proceeding further, get back to the hotel for breakfast and then head towards your cooking classes followed by lunch. After enjoying your classes, have the dinner with overnight stay in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1738, 83, 11, 'AGRA – LUCKNOW', 'Today, you will depart from Agra to Lucknow after your delicious breakfast at Agra. As per your arrival at Lucknow, check into the hotel and relax for a while. You will munch your lunch at hotel and then begin your visit to market for kebab, vegetables and spices. Rest of the time is at leisure. Return back to hotel for dinner and overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1739, 83, 12, 'LUCKNOW', 'The day is completely offered for the fortified Lucknow visit. So, begin your day schedule after your breakfast. You will be visiting Imambara and Jama Masjid. Then to learn the fantastic and famous dishes of Lucknow, you will take cooking classes. After enjoying in your classes, you will also enjoy the street eateries of Lucknow. Return to hotel for your dinner and stay overnight in Lucknow.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1740, 83, 13, 'LUCKNOW – KOLKATA', 'Get geared up to depart from this lovely destination Lucknow and head towards Kolkata after your delicious breakfast. Check into the hotel and relax for a while. Spend your time at leisure according to your choice. Later in the evening, enjoy Bengali cuisine at famous restaurant and roam around the busy streets of Kolkata. Return to the hotel and enjoy the dinner with overnight stay in the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1741, 83, 14, 'KOLKATA SIGHTSEEING', 'Sail across Hooghly River on the 14th day of your trip after breakfast. Enjoy and visit to the famous places of Kolkata such as Howrah Bridge, Indian Museum and Dakshineswar Kali Temple. After enjoying these sites again in the evening, you are going to enjoy at the famous restaurant for Bengali Thali in terracotta bowls, terracotta plate and on banana leaf. Later, proceed to hotel for your night stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1742, 83, 15, 'KOLKATA SIGHTSEEING', 'This is going to be the 2nd day in Kolkata. Today after your breakfast, you are going to visit Mother Teresa’s Mission, Birla Mandir and Victoria Memorial. Then the complete rest of the time is dedicated to the cooking classes to learn the famous Bengali cuisine. After the fruitful class, proceed to hotel and enjoy the stay with delicious dinner.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1743, 83, 16, 'KOLKATA DEPARTURE', 'This is the end of your Culinary tour of India for 15 Nights and 16 Days. You will be transferred to the airport to board your flight for onward journey. Leave the airport and get back to your country with tremendous knowledge of different cuisines, unforgettable memories and the glimpses of incredible Tour of Incredible India. Thanking you for giving us a chance to serve you.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-24 09:36:13'),
(1769, 51, 1, 'Arrive in Delhi', 'As per your flight schedule driver pickup you from Delhi Airport. And depart from Delhi to Agra. around 3 hours drive so late evening check in Agra hotel. overnight in Agra hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:42:14'),
(1770, 51, 2, 'Agra - Jaipur', 'Early morning at the time of Sunrise visit the Taj Mahal. (best time to visit the Taj). after the Taj Mahal tour back to the hotel for breakfast. and visit the Agra fort and depart from Agra to Jaipur around 4 hour drive, on the Way visit Fatehpur sikri Fort (Capital city of Akbar). evening check in Jaipur hotel over night rest in Jaipur hotel. overnight in Jaipur Hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:42:14'),
(1771, 51, 3, 'Jaipur- Delhi', 'After breakfast start your Guiding tour of Capital city of Rajasthan Jaipur.\r\n\r\nVisit:- Amber Fort, City Palace. Hawa Mahal, Jal Mahal, Jantar Mantar,\r\nafter the guiding tour of Jaipur visit Jaipur Bazaar and around 4 pm Depart from Jaipur to Delhi, Around 4/5 hour drive, evening around 9 pm driver transfer you to Delhi Airport/ Hotel/ Railway Station', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:42:14'),
(1783, 16, 1, '07:30', 'Our car will pick up you from hotel in Delhi and transfer to H Nizamuddin Railway station to board superfast air conditioned train to Agra. Our chauffer will assist you at railway station. We will E-mail you an E-ticket after booking confirmation.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1784, 16, 2, '08:10', 'Gatimaan Express ( Train No 12050 ) fully air conditioned train departs H Nizamuddin Railway Station for Agra Cantt railway station\r\n\r\n1) Breakfast included in Train fare\r\n2)Distance Travelled between Delhi & Agra by train in 1 : 40 Hrs.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1785, 16, 3, '09:50', 'Arriving Agra Cantt railway station. Your Tour Guide & Driver will receive you from Railway Station in Agra. Tour Start with drive to Taj Mahal by air conditioned car.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1786, 16, 4, '10:15', 'Taj Mahal is a cynosure of India in global tourism arena. The monument, constructed in 16th Century hold a grand history of true love and affection of 5th Mughal King Shah Jahan towards his beloved wife Mumtaj Mahal. This edifice is finest example of Indo Islamic architecture style situated on right bank of river Yamuna.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1787, 16, 5, '12:30', 'AGRA FORT After Taj Mahal drive to Agra Fort.The Fort made of red sand stone depicting glorious rule of the mighty Mughals with their lavish lifestyle. It was built in 15th century by third Mughal king Akbar. Encircled with two huge walls, this Fort has some impressive buildings like Jasmine Tower ,Khas Mahal , Diwan I Am , Diwan I Khas etc.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1788, 16, 6, '14:00', 'LUNCH BREAK You reserve right to recommend restaurant of your choice in Agra on direct payment otherwise your tour guide will take you to clean & hygenic AC Restaurant .', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:25'),
(1789, 16, 7, '15:00', 'ITMAD - UD - DAULAH ( BABY TAJ ) After Lunch proceed to Itmad-Ud-Daulah tomb. Due to some of its resemblance with Taj Mahal.This edifice is popularly known as \'\'Baby Taj\'\'.This tomb is elaborately carved with pure marble & exhibit Indo Islamic architecture style. Empress Noor Jahan ordered this tomb in memory of her father, Mirza Ghiyas Beg in 1622.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:26'),
(1790, 16, 8, '16:30', 'OPTIONAL After Baby Taj you can visit handicraft gallery of Marble inlay souvenirs in Agra city. Free to explore Agra City known for exporting marble inlay handicraft.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:26'),
(1791, 16, 9, '17:00', 'Transfer to Railway Station to board train to Delhi..', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:26'),
(1792, 16, 10, '17:50', 'Gatimaan Express( Train No 12049 ) departs for Delhi.. Dinner served in Train.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:26'),
(1793, 16, 11, '19:30', 'Arriving H Nizamuddin Railway Station. Our cab will transfer you back to your Hotel in Delhi. Tour End', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-26 12:43:26'),
(1796, 52, 1, 'Delhi – Agra', 'Our representative will report you around 7:00 AM to take you to Agra. Through Yamuna Express highway, it takes around 3 hours to reach Agra. After reaching Agra, our representative will welcome you and assist you in check in the hotel. After check in the hotel our representative will introduce you to your tour guide, who will guide you around the city and the Tajmahal as well. Now you can have some break for lunch or refreshment.\r\n\r\nProceed for sightseeing:-\r\nNow after having fresh mental and physical energy, first of all your guide will take you to Tajmahal, which is the main attraction in Agra. Before going to visit Tajmahal with moonlight view, it is better to visit Tajmahal in sun light as well with the guide, so that the guide can show you and explain you all the detail properly. As the guides are not allowed inside the Tajmahal with the tourist during moonlight view. After visiting Tajmahal you will be proceeded towards Agra Fort, which is made of red sand stone and surrounded by two high walls and two moths. After visiting these two monuments you can also visit handicraft bazaars, where you will see some handcrafted souvenirs. As Agra is famous for inlaid marble souvenirs. After completing your sightseeing you can go back to your hotel. You must have an early dinner in order to see the Tajmahal at night. After your dinner your driver will take you to Tajmahal according to the time which would be mention on your pre-booked ticket. As tourist must reach Shilpgram parking half an hour before the schedule time, mentioned on the ticket for the security checking. Now you will experience its beauty in silver moonlight. After having the wonderful moonlight view of Tajmahal, Hopefully your dream what you had over the years has come true today. Over Night in Agra.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:05'),
(1797, 52, 2, 'Agra to Delhi (via Fatehpur Sikri)', 'After having breakfast in your hotel, you would be proceeded to Delhi via Fatehpur Sikri. Now you are leaving the city of Tajmahal and proceed to Delhi via Fatehpur Sikri which is one hour west from Agra. Fatehpur Sikri is an amazing example of Mughal architecture and reflects a fusion of Hindu, Persian and Mughal art. Buland Darwaza which is the largest gate in Asian subcontinent belongs to Fatehpur Sikri. After your lunch you will be driven straight to Delhi without any stops or hassles\'.\r\n\r\nThis is a suggested itinerary – it can be changed to fit your individual hotels room types and requirements, as we are expert in designing custom tours based on the cities and monuments you want to visit and the number of days you have within your budget and time.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:05'),
(1809, 48, 1, 'Arrive Delhi', 'You will be met on your arrival at Delhi International Airport and transfer to the hotel. Overnight in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59');
INSERT INTO `package_itinerary` (`id`, `package_id`, `day_number`, `title`, `description`, `meals`, `accommodation`, `activities`, `display_order`, `created_at`) VALUES
(1810, 48, 2, 'In Delhi', 'Breakfast at the hotel followed by a full day sight-seeing tour of Old and New Delhi visiting - The Red Fort, Friday Mosque -- Jama Masjid, The silver street of Chandni Chowk, Raj Ghat, The Hindu temple -- Birla Mandir, The India Gate, The Rashtrapati Bhawan -- President\'s House, Humayun\'s Tomb, Qutub Minar and The Bahai Temple. Overnight in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1811, 48, 3, 'Delhi - Agra (220 kms /04 hrs)', 'After breakfast, depart for Agra by road. On your arrival in Agra check into the hotel. Afternoon sight-seeing tour of Agra visiting the Taj Mahal and the Red Fort. Overnight in Agra.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1812, 48, 4, 'Agra /Samode (275 kms /05 hrs)', 'After breakfast, depart for Samode by road en-route visiting Fatehpur Sikri. On your arrival check into the Samode Palace. The Samode Palace has been voted as one of the finest of the Rajasthan hotels. Overnight in Samode.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1813, 48, 5, 'Samode - Jaipur - Samode', 'Breakfast at the hotel followed by a full day excursion tour of Jaipur visiting Hawa Mahal -- The Palace of Winds, The Jantar Mantar, The City Palace and the Amber Fort. The memory of the ride up the Fort on a gaily bedecked Elephant, is something that will be remembered by you as a highlight of your Rajasthan tour. Overnight in Samode.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1814, 48, 6, 'Samode - Khimsar (330 kms / 06 hrs)', 'After breakfast, depart for Khimsar by road. On your arrival in Khimsar check-into the Khimsar Fort, another one of the fine heritage hotels in Rajasthan. Late afternoon Black buck safari followed by picnic tea on the nearby Sand Dunes. Overnight at the Khimsar Fort.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1815, 48, 7, 'Khimsar - Jodhpur - Khimsar', 'After breakfast, excursion tour of Jodhpur visiting The Mehrangarh Fort, The Jaswant Thada and The Sardar market. Overnight in Khimsar Fort.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1816, 48, 8, 'Khimsar - Udaipur (350 kms / 07 hrs)', 'After breakfast, depart for Udaipur by road. On your arrival in Udaipur, check-into the hotel Lake Palace, perhaps the most famous and the most photographed from among the long list of Rajasthan’s heritage hotels. Overnight in Udaipur.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1817, 48, 9, 'In Udaipur', 'Breakfast at the hotel followed by a sightseeing tour of Udaipur visiting City Palace, Jagdish Temple and Saheliyon ki bari. Evening sunset boat cruise on Lake Pichola. A private Boat cruise on the Lake Pichola, is something that you will long remember as one of the highlights of your Rajasthan tour. Overnight in Udaipur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1818, 48, 10, 'Udaipur - Delhi', 'After breakfast, transfer to airport intime to board flight for Delhi. Met on your arrival in Delhi and transferred to the hotel. Overnight in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1819, 48, 11, 'Depart Delhi', 'Check out from your hotel and transfer to Trivandrum airport intime to board your flight home.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:12:59'),
(1828, 47, 1, 'Arrival Delhi', 'Arrive Delhi, meet assist at the airport & transfer to hotel. Night stay in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1829, 47, 2, 'Delhi Sightseeing', 'After breakfast proceed for sightseeing tour of Old & New Delhi:\r\nOLD DELHI - A sight-seeing tour of Old Delhi would entail visiting the Raj Ghat - the memorial site where Mahatma Gandhi was cremated; Jama Masjid - the largest mosque in India.\r\n\r\nNEW DELHI - An extensive sight-seeing tour of New Delhi would include a visit to the Humayun\'s Tomb, the Qutub Minar, a drive along the ceremonial avenue - Rajpath, past the imposing India Gate, Parliament House, the President\'s Residence and would end with a drive through the Diplomatic Enclave. Night stay in Delhi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1830, 47, 3, 'Delhi - Jaipur (By train Dep 0610 Hrs Arr 1040 Hrs ) Palace of Winds', 'Early morning pick up from hotel & transfer to railway station to board the superfast airconditioned train to Jaipur. Breakfast in the train. Arrive Jaipur and transfer to hotel. Later sight seeing tour of Jaipur covering:\r\nAMBER FORT PALACE - Amber is the classic romantic Rajasthani fort palace. Its construction was started by Man Singh I in 1592, and completed by his descendent Jai Singh I. Its forbidding exterior belies an inner paradise where a beautiful fusion of Mughal and Hindu styles finds it\'s ultimate expression.\r\n\r\nCITY PALACE - A delightful blend of Mughal and traditional Rajasthani architecture, the City Palace sprawls over one-seventh of the area in the walled city. It houses the Chandra Mahal, Shri Govind Dev Temple and the City Palace Museum.\r\n\r\nJANTAR MANTAR - This is the largest and the best preserved of the five observatories built by Jai Singh II in different parts of the country. This observatory consisting of outsized astronomical instruments is still in use.\r\n\r\nHAWA MAHAL - The ornamental facade of this \"Palace of Winds\" is a prominent landmark in Jaipur. Their five-storey structures of sandstone plastered pink encrusted with fine trelliswork and elaborate balconies. The palace has 953 niches and windows. Built in 1799 by Pratap Singh, the Mahal was a royal grandstand for the palace women. Night stay in Jaipur.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1831, 47, 4, 'Jaipur - Agra', 'Morning drive to Agra via Fatehpur sikri , a perfectly preserved red sandstone “ghost town” which was the estranged capital of mughal emperor Akbar, built in 1569 and deserted when its water supply failed. Arrive Agra and transfer to hotel. Night stay in Agra.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1832, 47, 5, 'Agra Sightseeing', 'Morning at sunrise visit the magnificient Taj Mahal - one of the seven wonders of the world surely the most extravagant expression of love ever created. 20,000 men laboured for over 17 years to build this memorial to Shah Jahan\'s beloved wife.Also visit the Red fort - the rusty and majestic red- sandstone fort of Agra stands on the banks of the river Yamuna and the construction was started by Emperor Akbar in 1566. At the Diwan-I-Am (hall of public audience),a colonnaded hall of red-sandstone with a throne alcove of inlaid marble at the back, the Emperor heard public petitions. At the Diwan-I-Khas (hall of private audience) where marble pavilions with floral inlays lend an ethereal ambience, the Emperor sat on his gem-studded peacock Throne and met foreign ambassadors and rulers of friendly kingdoms. Evening free to explore the rich handicrafts of Agra. Night stay in Agra.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1833, 47, 6, 'Agra - Jhansi - Orchha', 'Morning transfer to railway station to board the train to Jhansi, Arrive Jhansi & drive to Orchha & transfer to hotel. Later tour of this historical site with magnificient temples and monuments. Some of the palaces were decorated with painted murals which represent the finest flowering of the Bundela school of painting. Night stay in Orchha.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1834, 47, 7, 'Orchha - Khajuraho', 'After breakfast drive to Khajuraho , The legendary temples of khajuraho are an incomparable experience. Acknowledged as one of the world’s artistic wonders, these temples dedicated to the Hindu pantheon of Gods are covered in carvings that are a paean to life and love. Built within a short span of a hundred years by the Chandela Rajputs, the 10th century temples lay forgotten until they were discovered in the present century. Khajuraho has achieved fame for the sensual appeal of its erotic sculptures. Arrive Khajuraho & transfer to hotel. Later explore the Western and Eastern temples of khajuraho while your guide explains the intricate meaning and legends behind each describable sculpture. Night stay in Khajuraho.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1835, 47, 8, 'Khajuraho- Delhi ( By flight )-Departure', 'After a relaxed breakfast transfer to airport to board the flight to Delhi to connect the onward flight.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:13:43'),
(1836, 39, 1, 'Delhi Arrival', 'our representative will greet and transfer you to hotel. Later you can enjoy a sumptuous dinner and stay overnight at the hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1837, 39, 2, 'Delhi Sightseeing', 'Take early morning delicious breakfast at the hotel and today you are going to feel the magic and charisma of Delhi, which is a very lively city. You are going to enjoy a full day sightseeing tour of Delhi, starting with impressive Red Fort, Jama Masjid - India’s oldest and largest mosque. You will also visit Qutub Minar-2nd tallest Minar in India, India Gate, Parliament House, the President\'s House. Our representative will also guide you through the ticketing process as well as the history and significance associated with these sites. You can also take rickshaw ride in the bustling bazaars at Chandni Chowk and tour to Khari Baoli spice market to witness the business markets as well as to eat mouth-watering Indian dishes. Return to your hotel in the evening for comforting overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1838, 39, 3, 'Delhi – Agra (The Taj Mahal)', 'After breakfast lead to Agra, the home of Taj. Upon arrival check in at hotel. Later in the afternoon take a guided tour to the visit of Agra Fort, the majestic fort of red sandstone stands on the banks of river Yamuna, continue to Itmad-ud-Daula’s tomb (baby Taj). Evening free to explore the local streets. Overnight at Agra hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1839, 39, 4, 'Agra - Jaipur', 'Early morning, you can visit Taj Mahal during the sunrise. Come Back Hotel for breakfast at the hotel and leave Agra Hotel for Jaipur. En route, you will visit Fatehpur Sikri, the deserted capital of the Mughal emperor Akbar. On arrival at Jaipur, our representative will transfer you to the hotel and later In evening, you can also do shopping in this beautiful city, which is famous for gemstone jewellry, pots as well as great traditional outfits. Return to the hotel for overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1840, 39, 5, 'Jaipur Sightseeing', 'breakfast at the hotel and get ready because it\'s time to explore and enjoy sightseeing in the Pink city of India - Jaipur, which is the capital city of Rajasthan state. Jaipur is Famous for Forts, Palaces and Rich Indian cultural Heritage. The traditional fortress is at Amber, so this is the logical place from which to begin your exploration. We will arrange an elephant safari for you to see the countryside around Amber. Later in the afternoon you will visit City Palace Museum - an imposing blend of traditional Mughal and Rajasthani Art. The museum is resplendent with its collection of robes of royal princes, carpets, and armory of old weapons, miniature paintings portraying court scenes, battle scenes and processions, After this, you will visit Albert Hall museum situated in Ram Niwas Garden, which has a rich collection of artifacts like paintings, metal sculptures, colorful crystal works. Later you will drive past the Hawa Mahal - The Palace of Winds and visit Jal Mahal- palace located in the middle of the Man Sagar Lake. Later you will have Dinner traditional Rajasthani food and return to your hotel for a relaxing overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1841, 39, 6, 'Jaipur-Udaipur', 'After breakfast at the hotel and you will leave for Udaipur. En route to Udaipur, you will visit Chittorgarh Fort which is acknowledged as the largest fort of India. On arrival in Udaipur, our representative will transfer you to the hotel. Later in the evening, you will go for the sightseeing tour of the breathtaking royal buildings around Lake Pichola in boat. Return to your hotel overnight stay.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1842, 39, 7, 'Udaipur sightseeing', 'Breakfast at the hotel and you will embark on sightseeing trip of Udaipur city, which is famously known as \"Venice of the East\" and \"City of Lakes\". You will visit the City Palace- it is the largest royal complex in Rajasthan, which stands on a rocky promontory and comprises of cupolas, balconies, and towers which gives a wonderful view of the lake and the city. After this you will visit Jagdish temple, which was built in 1651 A.D. by Maharana Jagat Singh, this Indo-Aryan temple is dedicated to Lord Jagannath, a manifestation of Vishnu and noted for its beautiful sculpted images and towering shikhara. Then you will drive through the old city of Udaipur to reach Fateh Sagar Lake and will also see Saheliyon-Ki-Bari - Courtyard of the Maidens was designed and laid out early in the eighteenth century as a retreat for ladies of the royal household to spend their time in leisure. Later in the evening you can visit Monsoon palace for sunset or you can do shopping in this beautiful city, which is famous for hand printed textiles, wall hangings, wooden folk toys and much more.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1843, 39, 8, 'Udaipur -Delhi (By Flight)', 'After having your breakfast at the hotel, our representative will transfer you to Udaipur Airport to board the flight for New Delhi. Continue your onward journey with sweet memories.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-27 14:14:27'),
(1844, 13, 1, 'Delhi Airport Arrival', 'Meet and assist by our representative upon your arrival at the airport and drive to hotel, Rest after Delhi Private Trip-\r\n\r\nRed Fort-Old Delhi-Rajghat-India Gate-Humyun tomb-lotus temple-Qutab miner', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1845, 13, 2, 'Delhi- Bikaner', 'After breakfast in drive to Bikaner via Mandawa, visit Mandawa and see the local village life-stay in Bikaner', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1846, 13, 3, 'Bikaner Jaislmer', 'After breakfast drive to Jaislmer city is one of India most beautiful, colorful & fascinating place. Arrive Jaislmer check in at Hotel. Stay Jaislmer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1847, 13, 4, 'Jaislmer Sightseen', 'After a relaxed breakfast proceed for full day sightseeing tour of The Golden City - Jaislmer. It is in the heart of the Great Indian Desert. Its temple, fort and palaces are all built of yellow stone. The city is a mass of intricately carved buildings, facades and elaborate balconies. visit the Jaislmer fort-oldest living fort , Desert Camel ride etc-Stay Jaislmer', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1848, 13, 5, 'Jaislmer Jodhpur', 'After breakfast drive to Jodhpur the Gateway to the Thar Desert. Arrive Jodhpur check in at hotel. After visit Jaswant Thada and Meharangarh-Stay Jodhpur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1849, 13, 6, 'Jodhpur Ranakpur', 'After breakfast drive to Ranakpur visit world famous 500 years old incredible jain temple with 1444 pillar, all pillar are different then each other. After jain temple visit to natural lake with very nice view of sun set-Stay Ranakpur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1850, 13, 7, 'Ranakpur Udaipur', 'After Ranakpur drive to Udaipur â€“the city of the lakes , arrive and stay in Udaipu', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1851, 13, 8, 'Udaipur Sightseen', 'This morning after breakfast visit Udaipur and see the nice lakes and life etc-Stay in Udaipur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1852, 13, 9, 'Udaipur Pushkar', 'After breakfast drive to Pushkar edge of the desert lies the tiny tranquil town of Pushkar along the bank of the picturesque Pushkar Lake. This is an important pilgrimage spot for the Hindus, which has the only temple of Lord Brahma in the country and one of the few in the world. Stay Pushkar', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1853, 13, 10, 'Pushkar Jaipur', 'After breakfast proceed to Jaipur the capital of Rajasthan, arrive Jaipur and check-inn and after the city tour.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1854, 13, 11, 'Jaipur Sightseen', 'Drive  to the Hawa Mahal, Jantar Mantar, City Palace , wind Palce amber fort  and the in-house Museum. Walk along the bazaars of the Pink City and enjoy the colorful life of the city. You will be amazed at the sight of the men and the women folk dressed in the most colorful way, especially ladies adorned with heavy silver jewelry-Stay Jaipur', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1855, 13, 12, 'Jaipur Ranthambore-National Game Park', 'After breakfast drive to Ranthambore national park, arrive afternoon and relex-stay Ranthambore', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1856, 13, 13, 'Ranthambore-National Game Park Safaris', 'This morning visit game park 6:00 am - 11:00 am Jeep safari and 2nd safari 14:00 pm to 18:00 Pm\r\n\r\nHere you have chance to see many animal and Indians tigers-night stay in Ranthambore', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1857, 13, 14, 'Ranthambore-Agra via fatepur sikri', 'After breakfast check out from the hotel and drive to city of marble Agra via fatepursikri-Stay Agra', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1858, 13, 15, 'Tajmahal Visit and drive to Khajuraho', 'Visit Tajmahal morning (sunrise) after breakfast and drive to Kamasutra city Khajuraho-Stay Khajuraho.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1859, 13, 16, 'Khajuraho Tour', 'After breakfast in hotel proceed to explore beautiful town Khajuraho. Khajuraho known for its temples built from 950 A.D to 1150 AD, by the Candela Dynasty. The group of thirty temples urahois an example of Indian architectural excellence The Western group of temples are best known for their erotic sculptures. Stay Khajuraho', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1860, 13, 17, 'Khajuraho Varanasi Flight', 'Driver drop you Khajuraho airport and flight to Varanasi , pickup Varanasi airport and move to the hotel\r\n\r\n After we take you to banks of the river Ganges where we board a boat to see the morning ablutions of the Hindus from the security of our boat.See the Kashi Vishwanath temple and the Gyanvyapi kund and the mosque attached to it. Also visit the Benares Hindu University the largest residential university in India with more than 3000 residential students', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-28 11:05:33'),
(1870, 42, 1, 'Arrive at Delhi', 'As per your flight schedule our represntative pickup you from Delhi Airport and transfer you to Delhi hotel. over night rest in Delhi hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1871, 42, 2, 'Delhi Guiding Tour', 'After Breakfast for full day side sightseeing like the Red Fort, Chandni Chowk Bazaar and Khari Baoli spice market on your way to visit Jama Masjid. One of the largest mosques in the world and the largest in India, it was built by Shah Jahan to dominate the city. Then, make your way to Raj Ghat, a memorial built to commemorate the site of Mahatma Gandhi’s cremation. Also visit the UNESCO World Heritage-listed Qutub Minar, India’s tallest minaret, made of red sandstone and marble and inscribed with verses from the Qur’an. Next stop Lotus Temple completed in 1986. Notable for its flowerlike shape, it serves as the Mother Temple of the Indian subcontinent and has become a prominent attraction in the city also visit Iskon Temple a famous Krishana Temple. Stop next at Humayun’s Tomb, another UNESCO World Heritage site and tomb of a Mughal emperor dating back to the 1500s. Next, pass under the high stone archway of India Gate – constructed in the memory of Indian soldiers who died in World War I – and drive along Rajpath (King\'s Way), the ceremonial boulevard heading toward Rashtrapati Bhavan, official home to the President of India. Also visit Birla Temple a Lord Vishnu Temple. Along the way, your guide will point out architectural and cultural features of these important monuments. over night rest in Delhi hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1872, 42, 3, 'Delhi - Jaipur', 'After breakfast depart from Delhi to Jaipur around 6 hour drive. evening check in Jaipur hotel.\r\nOver night rest in Jaipur hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1873, 42, 4, 'Jaipur', 'today proceeds to \'Pink City\' Jaipur. After Breakfast, Visit Amber - the ancient capital of the Rajput Empire reaching the fort on elephant back. It is a deserted palace surrounded by majestic ramparts & the magnificent public & private room\'s evidence the splendor of the rulers of 16th & 17th century Rajasthan. Also visit City Place, Janter Mantar and Hawa Mahal in evening leisure. Overnight at Hotel', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1874, 42, 5, 'Jaipur - Agra', 'After breakfast drive to Agra en-route visit Fatehpur Sikri. Later continue drive to Agra. Arrive and check in at Hotel. Akbarabad, as Agra was known during the Mughal era, is home to some of the most magnificent Mughal architectures. Situated on the banks of river Yamuna, the monumental beauty of Agra has inspired countless people around the world. This third largest city of the state of Uttar Pradesh is home to three UNESCO world heritage sites. Overnight at Hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1875, 42, 6, 'Agra - Varanasi', 'On day 06 of Delhi Agra Jaipur Varanasi Tour, Early morning at the time of sun rise visit the Taj mahal (best time to visit the Taj Mahal). after the Taj mahal back to the hotel for breakfast and visit the Agra Fort (world heritage site, baby Taj. Sikandra (tomb of Akbar). late evening catch the night train from Agra to Varanasi.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1876, 42, 7, 'Varanasi Arrival & City Tour', 'Arrive at Varanasi station. Meet and transfer to hotel for check in. Dating back to more than 3000 years, Varanasi is said to be the oldest city of the world. There are temples at every few steps here Hinduism it is believed that those who breathe their last in this city attain nirvana and get an instant gateway to liberation from the cycle of births and re-births. After Lunch proceed for tour planned for second half of the day We begin the tour of the city with the famous Banaras Hindu University. Next we visit the famous 18th century Durga temple dedicated to Goddess Durga & later visit one of the most famous temples of Varanasi, the Tulsi Manas temple.We end our tour with a oneof-its-kind temple the ‘Bharat Mata’ (Mother India). The temple was inaugurated by Mahatma Gandhi in 1936. The temple has the undivided India personified as a mother deity and has her statue built in marble. Unlike other temples, this one does not have images of the customary gods and goddesses; it houses a relief map of India, carved out of marble.Evening Aarti ceremony - Every evening, hundreds of people gather at the banks of the river Ganges to participate in the aarti (hymn). The evening aarti offers one of the most spectacular sensory experiences, when hundreds of lamps light up the river side at dusk, the entire city of Varanasi comes to a standstill and the sound of chimes and dongs reverberates in each and every street. Overnight at Hotel.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1877, 42, 8, 'Varanasi City Tour', 'Early morning proceed to morning Cruise on Ganges. The ‘Ghats of Ganga’ dotted with temples or more than 100 ghats (banks) alongside the Ganges in Varanasi. The best way to cover them all is acruise. A morning cruise on the Ganges presents a very beautiful view of the ghats bathed in crimson light. After Lunch half day excursion to Sarnath. Evening explore the city. A walk through old Varanasi will be memorable experience', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40'),
(1878, 42, 9, 'Varanasi Departure', 'Morning catch the train or flight from Varanasi to Delhi. driver pickup you from Delhi Train station/Airport. If you left some sight in Delhi you can visit today. evening driver transfer you Airport to catch your Early morning flight from Delhi. Tour to Varanasi ends.', NULL, NULL, NULL, 0, '2026-01-30 02:50:40');
