(52, 4, 'Taj Mahal Moon Tour', 'taj-mahal-moon-tour', 'A special night visit tour of the Taj Mahal under the moonlit sky.', 'Experience the magical beauty of the Taj Mahal under the moonlight on this exclusive Taj Mahal Moon Tour. Enjoy a night visit at the Taj, serene ambiance, and a unique romantic experience perfect for couples and culture seekers.', 2, 1, '6500.00', NULL, 'per_person', '695ce0b4ea7b1_1767694516.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Taj Mahal Moon Tour | Agra Night Visit & Taj Mahal Experience | Agra tour package', 'Tajmahal moon tours Tajmahal Tours', 'Taj Mahal Moon Tour, Taj Mahal night visit, Agra moonlight tour, Taj Mahal experience, Agra tour package', 1, 0, 0, 0, 51, '2026-01-03 09:51:48', '2026-01-29 16:08:36'),
