(54, 3, 'Rajasthan Varanasi Tour', 'rajasthan-varanasi-tour', 'A cultural and spiritual journey through Rajasthan’s royal cities and Varanasi’s sacred ghats.', 'Discover the vibrant culture and heritage of Rajasthan combined with the spiritual charm of Varanasi. This tour covers Delhi, Agra, Jaipur, Udaipur, Jodhpur and concludes with the sacred experiences of Varanasi’s Ganga Aarti and river cruise.', 19, 18, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '695cddc5eaf35_1767693765.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Rajasthan and Varanasi Tour | Delhi Jaipur Agra Udaipur Jodhpur Varanasi Package', 'Discover the vibrant culture and heritage of Rajasthan combined with the spiritual charm of Varanasi. This tour covers Delhi, Agra, Jaipur, Udaipur, Jodhpur and concludes with the sacred experiences of Varanasi’s Ganga Aarti and river cruise.', 'Rajasthan tour, Varanasi tour, Delhi Agra Jaipur Udaipur Jodhpur Varanasi, Rajasthan Varanasi package, India cultural tour', 1, 0, 0, 0, 51, '2026-01-03 10:04:22', '2026-01-29 07:56:22'),
(55, 5, 'Ayodhya Pilgrims Tour Package', 'ayodhya-pilgrims-tour-package', 'A devotional Ayodhya tour featuring holy temples and spiritual experiences on the banks of the Saryu River.', 'Embark on a spiritual journey with our Ayodhya Pilgrimage Tour Package. Visit sacred temples including Ram Janmabhoomi, Hanuman Garhi, Kanak Bhawan and attend the serene Ganga Aarti at Saryu River while enjoying personalized private travel arrangements.', 7, 6, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '695cdda5a6de6_1767693733.webp', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Ayodhya Pilgrimage Tour Package | Ayodhya Temple & Spiritual Tour', '', 'Ayodhya tour, Ayodhya pilgrimage, Ayodhya temple tour package, spiritual tour India, Ram Janmabhoomi tour', 1, 0, 0, 0, 42, '2026-01-03 10:10:48', '2026-01-28 17:43:35'),
(56, 11, 'Corbett Wildlife Tour', 'corbett-wildlife-tour', 'An exciting 5-day wildlife tour with multiple safaris in Jim Corbett National Park.', 'Experience thrilling wildlife adventures with the 5 Days Corbett Wildlife Tour. Explore the famous Jim Corbett National Park with premium safaris, diverse flora and fauna, and comfortable private transport and accommodations included.', 5, 4, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '695cdd820eccc_1767693698.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '5 Days Corbett Wildlife Tour | Jim Corbett National Park Safari Package | Corbett National Park trip', '', 'Corbett wildlife tour, Jim Corbett safari package, 5 days Corbett tour, wildlife holiday India, Corbett National Park trip', 1, 0, 0, 0, 45, '2026-01-03 10:17:24', '2026-01-28 17:43:37'),
(67, 2, 'Shimla Manali Tour Package from Delhi by Car', 'shimla-manali-tour-package-from-delhi-by-car', 'Enjoy a memorable 5-day road trip from Delhi to Manali and back. Explore the scenic hills of Himachal Pradesh with comfortable transfers, sightseeing in Manali and Shimla, and leisure time amidst snow-capped mountains and valleys.', 'Enjoy a memorable 5-day road trip from Delhi to Manali and back. Explore the scenic hills of Himachal Pradesh with comfortable transfers, sightseeing in Manali and Shimla, and leisure time amidst snow-capped mountains and valleys.', 6, 5, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '695cd2db6e72a_1767690971.jpeg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Delhi Manali Delhi Tour Package 5 Days | Shimla Manali Road Trip | 5 days Himachal tour', 'A 5-day road tour from Delhi to Manali and back featuring scenic mountain landscapes and Himachal sightseeing.', 'Delhi Manali tour package, Manali tour from Delhi, Himachal road trip, Shimla Manali package, 5 days Himachal tour', 1, 0, 0, 0, 53, '2026-01-06 08:37:28', '2026-01-29 14:09:36'),
(68, 14, 'Old Delhi Rickshwa Ride', 'old-delhi-rickshwa-ride', 'Explore the vibrant streets of Old Delhi on a traditional rickshaw ride through Chandni Chowk. Experience historic landmarks, colorful bazaars, and local life up close on this unforgettable heritage tour of Delhi’s old city.', 'Old Delhi Rickshaw Ride Tour offers a unique way to explore the historic heart of Delhi by taking you through its narrow lanes and vibrant streets. The tour highlights the contrast of old and new Delhi, allowing visitors to experience traditional markets, Mughal architecture, and local life up close', 1, 0, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '697468c87cc58_1769236680.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Old Delhi Rickshaw Ride, Rickshaw Ride in Old Delhi', 'Delhi is one of the best examples in the world where \'old meets new\'. A tour of Old Delhi offers a refreshing rickshaw ride experience, letting you encounter vibrant narrow lanes, historic bazaars, and iconic landmarks like Chandni Chowk, Jama Masjid, and the Red Fort.', 'Old Delhi Rickshaw Tour, Delhi Rickshaw Ride, Chandni Chowk Tour, Delhi Heritage Tour, Jama Masjid, Red Fort, Old Delhi Travel.', 1, 1, 0, 0, 34, '2026-01-24 06:38:00', '2026-01-30 04:05:30'),
(69, 14, 'Old Delhi Bicycle Tour', 'old-delhi-bicycle-tour', 'Experience Old Delhi on a guided morning bicycle tour from 06:00am to 10:00am. Ride through historic streets, bustling markets, and iconic landmarks while discovering the rich culture, heritage, and daily life of Delhi’s old city.', 'Explore the historic heart of Old Delhi on a guided bicycle tour from 06:00 am to 10:00 am. Pedal through narrow lanes once ruled by the Mughals and experience the city as it wakes up to its vibrant chaos and timeless charm. Tour highlights include the city wall, Jama Masjid, local bread bakery, Sikh temple, spice market, ancient havelis, and more. The ride ends with a pleasant breakfast, new friendships, and unforgettable stories of India’s rich heritage.', 1, 0, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69746ae529d2f_1769237221.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Old Delhi Bicycle Tour, Bicycle Tour in Old Delhi', 'Join the Old Delhi Bicycle Tour from 06:00 am to 10:00 am and cycle through the historic streets of Old Delhi. Discover iconic landmarks like Jama Masjid, spice markets, ancient havelis and more while enjoying breakfast and local culture on this guided morning ride.', 'Old Delhi Bicycle Tour, Old Delhi Bike Tour, Delhi Bicycle Tour, Morning Bicycle Tour Delhi, Jama Masjid Tour, Chandni Chowk Cycling, Delhi Heritage Bike Ride, Old Delhi Sightseeing Bike.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 27, '2026-01-24 06:46:27', '2026-01-30 04:50:20'),
(70, 14, 'Slum Tours Delhi', 'slum-tours-delhi', 'Discover life in Sanjay Colony with a guided 3-hour Slum Tour in Delhi. Walk through residential areas and small businesses, visit community spaces, and enjoy a family-style vegetarian lunch while learning about local culture and resilience.', 'The Slum Tours Delhi experience takes you on a meaningful walk through Sanjay Colony, a small urban community in South Delhi. Over approximately 3 hours, explore narrow lanes, observe daily life, and interact with residents as you visit small-scale workshops, a temple, a mosque, and residential zones. Gain insight into how families work with clothing recycling and manufacturing, and witness the spirit of community in the face of challenging living conditions. The tour concludes with a traditional vegetarian lunch in a local home, offering deeper cultural understanding and directly supporting a local family.', 1, 0, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69746b8f9fbef_1769237391.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', 'Slum Tours Delhi, Slum Walks in Delhi', 'Join the Slum Tours Delhi for a 3-hour guided walk through Sanjay Colony’s residential areas, small businesses, and community spaces. Experience local life up close and enjoy a traditional vegetarian lunch with a host family while gaining insight into Delhi’s vibrant community culture.', 'Slum Tours Delhi, Sanjay Colony Tour, Delhi Slum Walk, Delhi Community Tour, Slum Tourism Delhi, Local Life Tour Delhi, Cultural Walk Delhi.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 25, '2026-01-24 06:49:51', '2026-01-30 02:18:22'),
(71, 15, '08 Nights 09 Days Taste Of Kerala', '08-nights-09-days-taste-of-kerala', 'Experience the best of Kerala on an 08 Nights / 09 Days Taste of Kerala tour covering Cochin, Periyar, Alleppey, Kumarakom, and Mararikulam with scenic backwaters, wildlife, houseboat stay, beaches, and cultural highlights.', 'The 08 Nights 09 Days Taste of Kerala tour begins with your arrival in Cochin, where you’ll enjoy city sightseeing and a sunset backwater cruise. Continue to Periyar (Thekkady) for wildlife experiences and spice plantations. Next, head to Alleppey for a traditional houseboat cruise on the Vembanad Lake before moving to Kumarakom for relaxation, Ayurvedic spa treatments, and lakeside views. Finally, visit the tranquil coastal village of Mararikulam to explore local culture and beaches. The journey ends with your return to Cochin for departure. This package blends culture, nature, wildlife, and authentic Kerala experiences into one memorable holiday.', 8, 9, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69746f25e22b4_1769238309.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '08 Nights 09 Days Taste Of Kerala Tour, 09 Days 08 Nights Kerala Tour', 'Join the 08 Nights 09 Days Taste of Kerala tour to explore Cochin, Periyar, Alleppey, Kumarakom, and Mararikulam. Enjoy backwater cruises, wildlife sanctuary visits, houseboat stay, cultural sightseeing, beaches, and authentic Kerala experiences on this unforgettable South India holiday package.', 'Kerala tour, Taste of Kerala, Kerala holiday package, 8 nights 9 days Kerala, Cochin tour, Periyar wildlife tour, Alleppey houseboat, Kumarakom backwaters, Mararikulam beach tour.', 1, 1, 0, 0, 19, '2026-01-24 06:56:57', '2026-01-29 06:37:46'),
(72, 15, '08 Nights 09 Days Jewels Of South India', '08-nights-09-days-jewels-of-south-india', 'Explore South India on this 08 Nights / 09 Days Jewels of South India tour visiting Chennai, Mahabalipuram, Pondicherry, Thanjavur, Chettinad, Madurai, Periyar, Kumarakom (backwaters) and Cochin with rich culture, history, and scenic beauty.', 'This 08 Nights / 09 Days Jewels of South India tour starts in Chennai, known for its Dravidian heritage and coastal charm. Visit historic temples, museums and Marina Beach, then travel to Mahabalipuram to see UNESCO World Heritage Shore Temple and rock carvings. Continue to Pondicherry’s French quarters and spiritual sites, before heading south through Thanjavur, Chettinad and Madurai to enjoy cultural landmarks and cuisine. Enjoy wildlife and spice plantations at Periyar (Thekkady) followed by scenic backwaters in Kumarakom with a houseboat cruise, concluding your journey in Cochin with historic and cultural sightseeing.', 9, 8, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69746fef00000_1769238511.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '08 Nights 09 Days Jewels Of South India, 09 Days 08 Nights South India Tour', 'Discover the best of South India on the 08 Nights / 09 Days Jewels of South India tour covering Chennai, Mahabalipuram, Pondicherry, Thanjavur, Madurai, Periyar, Kumarakom backwaters and Cochin with cultural landmarks, heritage sites, wildlife and scenic experiences.', 'Jewels of South India tour, South India holiday package, Chennai tour, Mahabalipuram, Pondicherry tour, Thanjavur Chettinad, Madurai pilgrims tour, Periyar wildlife, Kumarakom backwaters, Cochin sightseeing.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 25, '2026-01-24 07:08:31', '2026-01-29 06:45:00'),
(73, 15, '10 Nights 11 Days Explore Kerala', '10-nights-11-days-explore-kerala', 'Experience Kerala in depth on this 18 Nights / 19 Days Kerala with a Difference tour, including backwaters, houseboat stays, tea hills, waterfalls, wildlife, forests, beaches and cultural highlights across the state.', 'The 18 Nights / 19 Days Kerala With a Difference tour begins in Cochin, exploring its colonial history and vibrant culture. Travel through lush backwaters in Alleppey with a houseboat cruise, then journey to Teekoy and the tea hills of Munnar. Visit the spectacular Athirapally waterfalls, the wildlife and spice regions of Wayanad, and the coastal town of Tellicherry before reaching tranquil Nileshwar. This extended Kerala itinerary blends nature, culture, wildlife, serene backwaters, hill stations and beaches for a comprehensive exploration of God’s Own Country.', 11, 10, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '697471ec99cf1_1769239020.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '10 Nights 11 Days Explore Kerala, 11 Days 10 Nights Kerala Tour', 'Enjoy an immersive 18 Nights / 19 Days Kerala with a Difference tour through Cochin, Alleppey, houseboats, tea hills, waterfalls, wildlife, forests and beaches for a unique and unforgettable Kerala experience.', 'Kerala tour package, Kerala with a Difference, 18 nights Kerala, Alleppey houseboat, Munnar tea hills, Athirapally waterfalls, Wayanad tour, Southern India travel, Tellicherry, Nileshwar, Cochin sightseeing.', 1, 0, 0, 0, 19, '2026-01-24 07:17:00', '2026-01-29 10:45:06'),
(74, 15, '12 Nights 13 Days Tea & Wildlife Trails', '12-nights-13-days-tea-wildlife-trails', 'A perfect blend of nature and adventure, exploring tea plantations and wildlife sanctuaries across South India.', 'The Tea & Wildlife Trails tour is designed for nature lovers and wildlife enthusiasts. Travel through scenic tea estates, misty hill stations, and renowned wildlife reserves. Experience lush green landscapes, exotic flora and fauna, and peaceful surroundings while enjoying eco-friendly and nature-focused travel experiences across South India.', 13, 12, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '697473ef4c88c_1769239535.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '12 Nights 13 Days Tea & Wildlife Trails, Kerala Wildlife Tour, Kerala Wildife Tour Packages', 'Explore scenic tea plantations and famous wildlife sanctuaries on the 12 Nights 13 Days Tea & Wildlife Trails tour across South India, perfect for nature lovers.', 'Tea and wildlife tour, South India wildlife tour, tea plantation tour India, wildlife holiday South India, nature tour South India', 1, 0, 0, 0, 23, '2026-01-24 07:25:35', '2026-01-29 16:26:04'),
(75, 15, '14 Nights 15 Days Mystical South India Tour', '14-nights-15-days-mystical-south-india-tour', 'Uncover the spiritual, cultural, and mystical charm of South India on this immersive 14 Nights / 15 Days tour.', 'The Mystical South India Tour takes you deep into the spiritual traditions, ancient temples, and sacred towns of South India. Experience centuries-old rituals, architectural wonders, cultural performances, and peaceful landscapes. This journey blends spirituality, history, and culture, offering travelers a meaningful and enriching travel experience.', 15, 14, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '697476a6ab548_1769240230.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '14 Nights 15 Days Mystical South India Tour, South India Tour 15 Days 14 Nights', 'Experience spirituality and heritage on the 14 Nights 15 Days Mystical South India Tour, featuring ancient temples, sacred towns, cultural traditions, and scenic beauty.', 'Mystical South India tour, spiritual South India tour, South India pilgrimage tour, South India cultural journey, temple tour South India', 1, 0, 0, 0, 19, '2026-01-24 07:31:25', '2026-01-29 08:12:22'),
(76, 15, '15 Nights 16 Days Southern Taste Of India', '15-nights-16-days-southern-taste-of-india', 'Experience the diverse culture, cuisine, and landscapes of South India on this grand 15 Nights / 16 Days tour.', 'The Southern Taste of India tour offers a complete South Indian experience covering cultural cities, spiritual centers, scenic hill stations, beaches, and backwaters. Discover regional cuisines, vibrant traditions, historic monuments, and natural beauty while traveling through multiple South Indian states. This tour is ideal for travelers seeking a deep and diverse cultural journey.', 16, 15, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '697477a57a434_1769240485.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '15 Nights 16 Days Southern Taste Of India, 16 Days 15 Nights South India Tour, South India Tour', 'Enjoy a complete cultural journey on the 15 Nights 16 Days Southern Taste of India tour featuring temples, beaches, hill stations, backwaters, and regional cuisine.', 'Southern Taste of India tour, South India grand tour, South India culture tour, South India travel package, South India sightseeing', 1, 0, 0, 0, 18, '2026-01-24 07:41:25', '2026-01-30 00:03:19'),
(77, 15, '18 Nights 19 Days Kerala With A Difference', '18-nights-19-days-kerala-with-a-difference', 'Explore Kerala beyond the usual routes with unique experiences on this 18 Nights / 19 Days Kerala With a Difference tour.', 'The Kerala With a Difference tour offers an off-the-beaten-path experience, showcasing lesser-known destinations, authentic village life, eco-tourism, and unique cultural encounters. Along with backwaters, beaches, and hill stations, this journey focuses on sustainable travel, local interactions, and deeper exploration of Kerala’s traditions and landscapes.', 19, 18, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69747b3f3bea0_1769241407.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '18 Nights 19 Days Kerala With A Difference, Kerala Tour Packages 19 Days', 'Discover offbeat destinations and authentic experiences on the 18 Nights 19 Days Kerala With a Difference tour, featuring villages, nature, culture, and eco-tourism.', 'Kerala with a difference tour, offbeat Kerala tour, Kerala eco tourism, unique Kerala holiday, Kerala village tour', 1, 0, 0, 0, 19, '2026-01-24 07:56:47', '2026-01-29 08:59:01'),
(78, 16, '09 Nights 10 Days Architecture Of Gujrat And Mumbai', '09-nights-10-days-architecture-of-gujrat-and-mumbai', 'Explore India’s architectural brilliance on this 09 Nights / 10 Days tour covering heritage cities of Gujarat and the iconic landmarks of Mumbai.', 'The Architecture of Gujarat and Mumbai tour showcases India’s diverse architectural styles, from ancient stepwells, temples, and historic palaces of Gujarat to colonial-era buildings and modern landmarks of Mumbai. This journey highlights Indo-Islamic, Hindu, Jain, and British architectural influences while offering cultural insights and city experiences across western India.', 10, 9, '0.00', NULL, 'per_person', '69748ada1a3aa_1769245402.jpg', NULL, NULL, 20, 0, 'easy', '', '', '09 Nights 10 Days Architecture Of Gujrat And Mumbai | Architecture of Gujarat and Mumbai Tour', 'Discover ancient temples, stepwells, palaces, and colonial landmarks on the 09 Nights 10 Days Architecture of Gujarat and Mumbai tour across western India.', 'Architecture tour of Gujarat, Gujarat architecture tour, Mumbai architecture tour, heritage tour India, architectural tour India', 1, 0, 0, 0, 28, '2026-01-24 08:59:15', '2026-01-29 23:47:05');
